   "source": [
    "# Developer Code Defect Prediction\n",
    "\n",
    "## Machine Learning Model Training\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook trains and evaluates multiple Machine Learning classification models for software defect prediction.\n",
    "\n",
    "The objective is to predict whether a software module is defective based on software engineering metrics.\n",
    "\n",
    "### Models\n",
    "\n",
    "- Logistic Regression\n",
    "- Random Forest\n",
    "- Gradient Boosting\n",
    "- XGBoost\n",
    "- Support Vector Machine\n",
    "\n",
    "### Evaluation Metrics\n",
    "\n",
    "- Accuracy\n",
    "- Precision\n",
    "- Recall\n",
    "- F1-score\n",
    "- ROC-AUC\n",
    "- Confusion Matrix\n",
    "- Stratified Cross-Validation\n",
    "\n",
    "The final model will be selected based on validation performance rather than accuracy alone."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "1bb911c1",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "\n",
    "from sklearn.linear_model import LogisticRegression\n",
    "from sklearn.ensemble import RandomForestClassifier, GradientBoostingClassifier\n",
    "from sklearn.svm import SVC\n",
    "\n",
    "from sklearn.metrics import (\n",
    "    accuracy_score,\n",
    "    precision_score,\n",
    "    recall_score,\n",
    "    f1_score,\n",
    "    roc_auc_score,\n",
    "    confusion_matrix,\n",
    "    classification_report,\n",
    "    ConfusionMatrixDisplay\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "from sklearn.model_selection import StratifiedKFold, cross_val_score\n",
    "\n",
    "from xgboost import XGBClassifier"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "7aa3b386",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Load Preprocessed Data\n",
    "\n",
    "The training and testing datasets generated during the preprocessing stage are loaded.\n",
    "\n",
    "The test set remains untouched and is used only for final model evaluation."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "18fd0ae6",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
