   "source": [
    "## 3. Feature Scaling\n",
    "\n",
    "Standardized features are created for scale-sensitive algorithms such as Logistic Regression and Support Vector Machine.\n",
    "\n",
    "The scaler is fitted using the training data only."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 4,
   "id": "6a8fb7a7",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
