    "## 14. Handling Class Imbalance\n",
    "\n",
    "The dataset contains fewer defective modules than non-defective modules.\n",
    "\n",
    "Two approaches are investigated:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Class weighting\n",
    "2. SMOTE (Synthetic Minority Over-sampling Technique)\n",
    "\n",
    "SMOTE is applied only to training folds through an imbalanced-learn pipeline to avoid data leakage."
   ]
